I walk onto the court.
Kasper serves the shuttlecock.
I have to run fast.
I hit the shuttlecock hard.
It flies high up in the air.
Sara runs and hits it back.
We play for a long time.
I run from side to side.
I want to win.
But it is difficult.
I breathe heavily.
I sweat a lot.
